---
description: Kysely APP_DB access and schema sync rules
globs: src/database/**/*.ts,src/modules/**/*.service.ts,db/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Kysely / database

- Inject `@Inject(APP_DB) private readonly db: Kysely<DB>`
- Types: `src/database/schema.ts` must match `db/schema/schema.sql`
- SQL lives under `db/`, never under `src/`
- No TypeORM / Prisma / query builders other than Kysely
- Always filter tenant-scoped tables by `tenant_id`
- Apply schema with `psql` per `db/README.md` — no in-app migrator yet
- Do not treat `docs/db/migrations/` as the live schema (future RLS)

When changing tables: update `db/schema/schema.sql` and `src/database/schema.ts` together. Use the `kysely-schema-sync` skill.
